OL,3,GNEWSATaxi driver concerns prompted by
OL,4,Asocial media clip
OL,5,
OL,6,FTaxi passengers have been reassured
OL,7,Fdangerous bogus cab drivers are in the
OL,8,Fminority after footage circulating
OL,9,Fonline prompted concerns.
OL,11,FA short clip taken from a council
OL,12,Fmeeting referenced drivers sexually
OL,13,Fexploiting vulnerable women, which
OL,14,FNewcastle City Council said had left
OL,15,Fpeople with an unrealistic view of the
OL,16,Fscale of the danger.
OL,18,FAt the meeting, Northumbria Police had
OL,19,Foutlined Operation Salus which aims to
OL,20,Fprotect people on a night out and
OL,21,Fshared some examples of drivers preying
OL,22,Fon women.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
