OL,5,
OL,6,FBut licensing committee member Owen
OL,7,FBurbidge said: "Across the hundreds of
OL,8,Fthousands of journeys taken each year,
OL,9,Fand the millions of miles covered,
OL,10,Fcomplaints about taxis remain very
OL,11,Flow."
